1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,767
AccessPath is now live on Render.

2
00:00:03,797 --> 00:00:07,366
Explore fictional forms using synthetic
sample answers.

3
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:12,256
The scholarship form is fictional, but its
language is deliberately difficult.

4
00:00:12,286 --> 00:00:15,049
Here is the original source, before
guidance.

5
00:00:17,952 --> 00:00:20,715
Hosted Qwen explains source instructions
through Groq.

6
00:00:20,745 --> 00:00:22,227
Your answers are excluded.

7
00:00:22,257 --> 00:00:24,661
Compare each suggestion with the original.

8
00:00:25,328 --> 00:00:26,878
Confirm the source checklist.

9
00:00:26,908 --> 00:00:28,723
No documents are uploaded.

10
00:00:29,409 --> 00:00:32,617
Use the supplied sample answers, one
question at a time.

11
00:00:32,647 --> 00:00:35,354
Choices and required fields follow the
source.

12
00:00:35,384 --> 00:00:38,734
This public demo accepts synthetic details
only.

13
00:00:47,734 --> 00:00:49,766
The statement keeps the source limits.

14
00:00:49,796 --> 00:00:54,484
Sample text demonstrates completion without
collecting a real applicant's story.

15
00:00:55,498 --> 00:00:56,943
Review before sending.

16
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:59,930
The submit button stays disabled until you
confirm.

17
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:03,123
Editing an answer invalidates that
confirmation.

18
00:01:15,769 --> 00:01:18,799
A real browser submits only the private
fictional portal.

19
00:01:18,829 --> 00:01:23,211
This receipt confirms the demo action,
without contacting a real agency.

20
00:01:23,948 --> 00:01:27,618
Synthetic drafts stay temporarily on Render,
not on your device.

21
00:01:27,648 --> 00:01:30,798
Delete your draft and activity, or let it
expire.
